  "code": "2794",
  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"1227\">\n<p data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"1001\"><strong data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"978\">Positive LC-1 Antibodies</strong> are associated with:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1227\">\n<li data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1043\">\n<p data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1043\">Autoimmune Hepatitis Type 2 (AIH-2)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1116\">\n<p data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1116\">Often found alongside <strong data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1114\">LKM-1 (Liver Kidney Microsomal Antibody)</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1166\">\n<p data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1166\">Typically affects children and young adults</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1227\">\n<p data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1227\">May indicate progressive liver inflammation if untreated</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1336\">\n<p data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1336\"><strong data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1244\">Negative:</strong> No evidence of LC-1 autoantibody. Does not exclude other forms of autoimmune liver disease.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
